#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Check your understanding {#check-your-understanding-1}"
msgstr "ทดสอบความเข้าใจ {#check-your-understanding-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Call the set of all computational basis states that make up your ansatz A. "
"Call the set of all computational basis states that make up the true ground "
"state of your system G. Which of the following corresponds to a 'good' "
"ansatz? Select all that apply:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
